--- !u!114 &2547103942606094687
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7455526400851737978}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 270c2ff6d429c0b458c7c9826ae73f88, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pages:
  - title: Punch
    body: Press A to punch. and press forward and A to do a moving punch, covering
      more distance. Punches count for 1 point
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 26b31391899257a48b1d192eb8ced599, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 1fd68cae93c72144f8b74a8305f32840, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Kick
    body: Press B to Kick. and press forward and B to do a moving Kick, covering
      more distance. Kicks awards you 2 points. first to score 10 points, or the
      highest points at the end of time, Wins
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c0917d61423e24c4fb82587d4323b02c, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 9ddf0c195e5e2304d9aa9f1ad6e8d0bd, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Dodge
    body: Dodge out of range of incoming attacks
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 792287f827c488f47a11c73f6690b074, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: fd9f0a3cd09ae5c4c96e0dace594b141, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Block
    body: Block incoming attacks. Blocks cause Posture Damage to the Player
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 905fe8aac1f88a944923e7883a93cc54, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 128951d25f028c3458f39cb1e699dae7, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: QuickPunch
    body: Right after a parry, the Enemy is open to a quick punch. Press the punch
      button, Press the forward button and punch button together to cover more distance
      if needed. Kicks wont work here
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 905fe8aac1f88a944923e7883a93cc54, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7c256523c1610e24a819eb54509c9ac8, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Parry
    body: 'Pressing the Block Button when the enemy''s attack lines are red, lets
      you parry the enemy.

      Parrying does not cause any posture damage to the
      player, but causes damage to the opponent'
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 905fe8aac1f88a944923e7883a93cc54, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 44aadd04803ab5c4e83c369458e6709e, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Stun
    body: 'When a character''s Posture damage meter is full, they get stunned and
      are completely open to all attacks. '
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 7ae03fc07f035a0478ad0e2ee3d6d4db, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Out of bounds
    body: If you are thrown out of bounds, you get a warning. 2 warnings leads to
      a point deduction
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 0}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: b048bde600f490e4b991584ff4965b2c, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
  - title: Swap
    body: 'when cornered, and the Opponent THROWS A PUNCH, quickly tap Y to swap
      places with them and throw them out of the mat instead. This only works against
      enemy punches, not their kicks


      All controls can be viewed in the Pause
      Menu '
    controls: 
    controlsIcon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1f13b04d8dd1bfa4e823ddd2bd66b704, type: 3}
    clip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c530d51a7fad0f54a9032c02bfe6f156, type: 3}
    image: {fileID: 0}
